<!doctype html>
<html lang="nb">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"><title>Designverksted</title><style nonce="{{NONCE}}">{{APPLICATION_STYLE}}</style></head>
<body>
<a class="skip-link" href="#workspace-tools">Hopp til designverktøy</a>
<header class="app-header"><div class="app-identity"><span class="wordmark">Designverksted</span><span class="header-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span><h1 id="app-title">Lokal app</h1></div><div class="app-location"><span id="connection-dot" class="connection-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><p id="app-status">Kobler til arbeidet …</p><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><p id="app-route">/</p></div><p id="reopened-note" class="reopened-note" hidden>Lagrede innspill er åpnet igjen. Appen starter i en ny økt; ulagrede appfelt kan være nullstilt.</p><p class="reopened-note" id="health-message" role="status" hidden>Appen har registrerte feil. Du kan fortsatt gi innspill. Be i samtalen om å undersøke appvisningen.</p><div class="surface-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Arbeidsunderlag"><button type="button" id="app-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="app-surface" tabindex="0">Appen nå</button><button type="button" id="proposal-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="proposal-surface" tabindex="-1">Forslag <span class="proposal-new" id="proposal-new" hidden>Ny</span></button></div></header>
<section class="retired-message" id="retired-message" aria-labelledby="retired-title" hidden><h2 id="retired-title" tabindex="-1">Denne visningen er ikke aktiv</h2><p>Verkstedet er lukket. Be om å åpne det igjen i samtalen. Lagrede rom beholdes. Kopier eventuell ulagret tekst først. Denne visningen kan ikke lagre eller sende.</p><button class="button secondary" id="show-local-draft" type="button" hidden>Vis og merk ulagret tekst</button><textarea id="local-draft-copy" aria-label="Ulagret tekst som kan kopieres" readonly hidden></textarea></section>
<div id="app-surface" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="app-tab"><div class="workspace" id="workspace">
<main class="preview-stage" aria-label="Appen du arbeider med"><div class="preview-topline"><span id="preview-label">Prøv appen som vanlig</span><span id="width-label">Tilpasset bredde</span></div><div class="preview-surface"><div class="preview-scroll"><div class="preview-viewport" id="preview-viewport"><iframe id="app-preview" title="Lokal app" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></iframe></div></div></div><div class="stage-message" id="stage-message" role="status"><strong id="stage-title" tabindex="-1">Åpner appen</strong><p id="stage-help">Innspill samles her når visningen er klar.</p><button class="button secondary" id="retry-preview" type="button" hidden>Prøv å åpne appen igjen</button></div></main>
<div class="panel-backdrop" id="panel-backdrop" hidden></div><aside class="side-panel" id="side-panel" aria-labelledby="panel-title" hidden>
<div class="panel-heading"><div><h2 id="panel-title" tabindex="-1">Innspill</h2></div><button class="icon-button" id="close-panel" type="button" aria-label="Lukk panelet">×</button></div>
<section id="compose-pane" class="panel-content" hidden>
<div id="selection-empty"><div class="empty-icon" aria-hidden="true">↖</div><h3>Hva vil du endre?</h3><p>Velg et element i appen. Du kan også gi et innspill til hele siden.</p><button type="button" id="pick-part" class="button primary">Velg del i appen</button><button type="button" id="whole-page" class="button secondary">Om hele siden</button><p class="quiet-help">Velg del åpner en liste som kan brukes med tastatur. Du kan også peke på noe i appen.</p></div>
<form id="comment-form" hidden>
<div class="target-summary"><div><span class="eyebrow">Valgt del</span><h3 id="target-label"></h3><p class="target-route" id="target-route"></p></div></div>
<div class="draft-change" id="draft-change" role="group" aria-labelledby="draft-change-title" hidden><h3 id="draft-change-title">Du har et uferdig innspill</h3><p>Vil du fortsette med det, eller forkaste teksten og velge den nye delen?</p><div class="button-row"><button class="button secondary" id="keep-draft" type="button">Fortsett innspillet</button><button class="button quiet danger" id="discard-for-target" type="button">Forkast og bytt del</button></div></div>
<label class="field-label" for="comment-text">Hva vil du endre?</label><textarea id="comment-text" rows="5" aria-describedby="comment-help comment-limit" placeholder="For eksempel: Gjør det tydeligere hvilken avtale denne knappen gjelder."></textarea><div class="field-meta"><p id="comment-help">Beskriv ønsket. Samle flere innspill før du sender.</p><span id="comment-limit"></span></div>
<p class="notice" id="selection-stale" hidden>Appen har endret side. Innspillet gjelder delen og siden du valgte tidligere.</p><p class="notice" id="comment-retry-note" hidden>Lagringen er ikke bekreftet. Prøv samme lagring igjen før du endrer innspillet.</p><p class="error-message" id="comment-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
<div class="compose-actions"><button class="button primary" id="save-comment" type="submit">Lagre innspill</button><button class="button quiet" id="clear-draft" type="button">Forkast utkast</button></div><p class="quiet-help">⌘/Ctrl + Enter lagrer · Esc legger utkastet til side. Sending velger du i Innspill.</p>
</form></section>
<section id="feedback-pane" class="feedback-pane" hidden><div class="basket-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Innspill"><button id="pending-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="feedback-list" tabindex="0">Klar til sending <span id="pending-count" class="count">0</span></button><button id="sent-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="feedback-list" tabindex="-1">Sendt <span id="sent-count" class="count">0</span></button></div><div class="review-progress" id="review-progress" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" hidden><p class="review-progress-title" id="review-progress-title"></p><p id="review-progress-help"></p><button id="review-progress-proposal" class="button primary" type="button" hidden>Vis forslag</button></div><div id="feedback-list" class="feedback-list" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="pending-tab" tabindex="0"></div><div class="basket-footer" id="basket-footer"><p id="submit-help">Samle innspill og send dem når du er klar.</p><p class="error-message" id="submit-error" role="alert" hidden></p><button class="button primary" type="button" id="submit-feedback" aria-describedby="submit-help">Send innspill</button></div></section>
<div class="panel-bottom"><button class="button secondary mobile-panel-browse" id="panel-browse" type="button">Prøv appen</button><span class="small-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><p id="storage-note">Midlertidig økt · ikke lagret i prosjektet.</p></div>
</aside></div>
<div class="workbench" id="workspace-tools" tabindex="-1"><div class="main-tools" role="group" aria-label="Arbeidsmåte"><button class="tool-button" id="mode-browse" type="button" aria-pressed="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 3 14 9-7 1-3 7z"/></svg>Prøv</button><button class="tool-button" id="mode-change" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4zM8 9h8m-8 3h5"/></svg>Endre</button></div><span class="tool-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="secondary-tools"><button class="tool-button" id="open-feedback" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="side-panel">Innspill <span class="count" id="feedback-count">0</span></button><button class="tool-button draft-tool" id="resume-draft" type="button" hidden>Fortsett utkast</button></div><div class="viewport-tools" role="group" aria-label="Visningsbredde"><button class="width-button" id="width-fit" type="button" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Tilpass visningen til tilgjengelig bredde" title="Tilpass bredde">↔</button><button class="width-button" id="width-desktop" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Stor skjerm, 1280 piksler" title="Stor skjerm · 1280 px"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M8 20h8m-4-4v4"/></svg></button><button class="width-button" id="width-mobile" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Mobil, 375 piksler" title="Mobil · 375 px"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="7" y="2" width="10" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M11 18h2"/></svg></button></div></div>
</div><section class="proposal-surface" id="proposal-surface" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="proposal-tab" hidden><div class="proposal-message" id="proposal-message" role="status"><h2 id="proposal-message-title" tabindex="-1">Ingen forslag ennå</h2><p id="proposal-message-help">Beskriv hva du vil endre i samtalen, eller gi et innspill i Appen nå. Forslaget vises her.</p><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="proposal-back" hidden>Tilbake til appen</button></div><iframe id="proposal-preview" title="Forslag" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" hidden></iframe></section>
<div class="navigation-message" id="navigation-message" role="status" hidden><p>Lenken går utenfor den lokale appen og er ikke åpnet. Fortsett i appen her.</p><button class="button secondary" id="return-to-app" type="button">Tilbake til appen</button></div><div class="global-message" id="global-message" role="alert" hidden><p id="global-message-text"></p><button class="button secondary" id="retry-state" type="button">Prøv igjen</button></div><p class="sr-only" id="announcement" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
<script nonce="{{NONCE}}">window.__designApplication = {{APPLICATION_CONFIG}};</script><script nonce="{{NONCE}}">{{APPLICATION_SCRIPT}}</script>
</body></html>
